Stickers from other sets, shipped inside Cutlass

noto-emoji/
  Noto Emoji, by Google.
  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
  The 512 pixel PNGs from png/512/ at commit
  41e31b110b4eb929dffb410264694a06205b7ad7 (15 February 2024), when the
  repository's images were under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The
  license text from that commit is noto-emoji/LICENSE. The files are
  unchanged.

noto-emoji-animation/
  Noto Animated Emoji, by Google.
  https://googlefonts.github.io/noto-emoji-animation/
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  The full license is noto-emoji-animation/LICENSE.
  Each file is lottie.json from
  https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/latest/<codepoint>/lottie.json,
  fetched on 5 November 2026 and saved as emoji_u<codepoint>.json. The
  files are unchanged.

Cutlass credits both sets in its Licenses window.
